<description>&lt;p&gt;ISIL carried out a suicide bombing in Hasakah that killed two Syrian internal security members and injured five others. The same attack was described as a motorcycle bomb in northeast Syria, targeting a security post. CENTCOM praised Syrian authorities for disrupting a drug and weapons smuggling network. The conflict continues with frequent attacks on security forces in the northeast. 2,732 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/26/two-syrian-security-personnel-killed-in-isil-suicide-attack?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxPUUM4WEVwSURQOThVOUx0ZHBsSklPYmpPRHNmXzRaR3pJcFNqTWJOYjNKeUE3SVFvS3dnTnhtekhMMmw1enMzXzh6VW1mNWlSckozeVE2eWphMFJQRVFLRHVDcGpJTVQweXhJRVBrdHJXOTlBUVBUbFZ4YXRPQUtKQjZqTTFDeUdTbWd6ckxQQnNQTDhMbnVWM0NYV3NSYVpMMFo0eEJKUHliMEJnWF8tYzQ1SWN6eUJzNGJadVZiNEk5ZHR6T3Y4S0NB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The National&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxQYWdhQ1lWdWZNemUxbGFFYWZ5U2pOci10Wkdxc2Y3bFFLVnhxV2g3QlZRbENXU21BNUZUbE5VcTJjQmszck5QcnBUaWhqU3dDM2tXYU9QbUMtMEhuTHJaLUNCVDNOcUdqUmxZWXNzanFzZWJBU2hsc3ZnY29zeDdNbmdKX2tiUUE5c0V0WFNEY1Y5T21LNWtfLVZzQXJybDRsdjlOLXQ5WGFGWm1feWd3Y2NQR2pOVERza2VhYmxBQnBpYXRMNHhSblZUWnlsZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;NewsCord&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE1rRVFWM09USVZMa1F1aVE0S21EOVFYLThnWV83U3BxVmxiTFlaWWJrbm4tS3lVcFpVcVVkdzlvR3lMSnJyWWE1bi1BYWI4aU9BUXFuVzNsSzZ3aGFvZ0Q0QzQ4Q1g2bzTSAVxBVV95cUxQaFNYYnZIOXBjWGJSaDY0aFdieVotZHJzTFpRdmhaUVVvQnJERi1qbjJZckEzdlE1U1gzcXdONTdEOXRpeE15clFVNEg4SmQ3ZkhNdEFXbktPa2tMbA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Ghana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.goo